{"ref":"BDB, אֲבָל","hw":"אֲבָל","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבָל</span></big></big>  <strong>adv. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in older Heb. with an asseverative force, <strong>verily, of a truth</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:21\" href=\"/Genesis.42.21\">Gn 42:21</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.5\">2 S 14:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:43\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.43\">1 K 1:43</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.14\">2 K 4:14</a>, with a slight advers. force, <strong>nay, but</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:19\" href=\"/Genesis.17.19\">Gn 17:19</a> (P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  in late Heb. as a decided adversative, <strong>howbeit, but</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:7\" href=\"/Daniel.10.7\">Dn 10:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:21\" href=\"/Daniel.10.21\">21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:13\" href=\"/Ezra.10.13\">Ezr 10:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.4\">2 Ch 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.3\">19:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.17\">33:17</a> (cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَلْ</span> <em>of a truth</em>, sometimes, from the context, <em>nay rather</em> Qor 2:82, 94, 110, 129, 149, 165, 261; 3:143; 4:52 etc.)","next":"BDB, אבל²","prev":"BDB, אָבֵל²"}